        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebihongwa ebya butoosa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ragira abantu ba Isirairi obagambire ngu: ‘Ekihongwa kyange, ebyokulya byange eby'ebihongwa eby'okwokya ebirugwamu ekisorrokoko ekinyakunsemereza, mutehoga omutima kubimpongera omu kasumi kaabyo akanyakusemeriire.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi obagambire ngu: Kinu nikyo kihongwa eky'okwokya eki muraahongeraga MUKAMA: Ebyana by'entaama ebihaya bibiri eby'omwaka gumu, ebitaina kamogo, ebi mubihongege buli kiro, kibe kihongwa eky'oruteekerro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyana ky'entaama ekimu, mukihongege nyenkya, ekindi mukihongege orwebagyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muhongege kiloguraamu emu ey'ensaano enyakutabwire na kiloguraamu emu ey'amagita aganyakuhonzirwe, kibe kihongwa eky'ebyokulya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eki nikyo kihongwa eky'okwokya eky'oruteekerro, ekyaragiirwe ha rusozi Sinai, kirugwemu ekisorrokoko ekirukuboya, nikyo kihongwa eky'okwokya eky'okuhongera MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekihongwa kyakyo eky'ekyokunywa, kibege lita emu erukugenda hamu na buli kyana ky'entaama; omukiikaro ekirukwera, nuho museesege ekihongwa eky'ekyokunywa eky'amaani eky'okuhongera MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyana ky'entaama ekindi, mukihongege orwebagyo; nkooku muhongerege nyenkya ekihongwa eky'ebyokulya, hamu n'ekihongwa kyakyo eky'ekyokunywa, kibe kihongwa eky'okwokya, ekirukurugwamu ekisorrokoko ekirukuboyera MUKAMA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ha kiro ekya Sabbato, muhongege ebyana by'entaama ebihaya bibiri eby'omwaka gumu, ebitaina kamogo, na kiloguraamu ibiri ez'ensaano enyakuniinuukire kurungi, enyakutabwire n'amagita, kibe kihongwa eky'ebyokulya hamu n'ekihongwa kyakyo eky'ekyokunywa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eki nikyo kiraabaga kihongwa eky'okwokya ekiraahongwaga buli Sabbato, otabaliireho ekihongwa eky'okwokya ekya butoosa, hamu n'ekihongwa kyakyo eky'okunywa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ameezi ganyu obu garaabaga nigaboneka, muhongerege MUKAMA ekihongwa eky'okwokya: ekihongwa eki, nizo enimi ento ibiri, entaama empaya emu, ebyana by'entaama ebihaya musanju ebitaina kamogo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kiloguraamu isatu ez'ensaano enyakuniinuukire kurungi, etabwire n'amagita, erukuhongwa hamu na buli nimi, na kiloguraamu ibiri z'ensaano enyakuniinuukire kurungi, etabwire n'amagita, erukuhongwa hamu n'empaya y'entaama kibe kihongwa eky'ebyokulya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiloguraamu emu ey'ensaano enyakuniinuukire kurungi, etabwirwe n'amagita, erukuhongwa hamu na buli kyana ky'entama, kibe kihongwa eky'ebyokulya; kibe kihongwa eky'okwokya ekirukurugwamu ekisorrokoko ekirukuboya, ekihongwa eky'okwokeza MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebihongwa eby'ebyokunywa, bibege lita ibiri ezirukuhongwa hamu n'enimi, lita emu n'ekicweka ezirukuhongwa hamu n'empaya y'entaama, na lita emu ezirukuhongwa hamu n'ekyana ky'entaama; eki nikyo kibege kihongwa eky'okwokya ekya buli kwezi, okumara omwaka gwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi muhongerege MUKAMA empaya y'emburabuzi ebe kihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi; eki kyongerwege ha kihongwa eky'okwokya ekya butoosa, na ha kihongwa kyakyo eky'ekyokunywa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
